Given a description of a software feature and a list of other software feature descriptions, your task is to determine if the initial feature matches any features in the list.

Return only a JSON object containing:
- match: true if any listed feature is exactly or semantically equivalent to the base feature, otherwise false
- match_index: array of matching zero-based indices; include only when match is true
- combined_text: concise description of the shared feature; include only when match is true

Do not include reasoning, tags, Markdown, or other text.
